{"unit_id":"Rccccc6__Tongji-AGI-Credit#card-zh","repo":"Rccccc6/Tongji-AGI-Credit","commit":"bc18771cf6872abbbaa73082fcbfa8ba59fff898","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Tongji AGI Credit 是面向 DSH 桌面环境的同济大学 AGI 积分插件。它在 DSH 页面注入独立积分面板，并提供本机回环接口和小鲸鱼挂件桥接。主要功能包括查询剩余与已用积分、查看今日用量、加密保存登录配置，以及将余额和今日用量接入挂件。适合同济 AGI 用户查看积分并在 DSH 中集中展示。需要同济统一身份认证账号；积分由同济 AGI 服务提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:79-150","lib/agi-session.mjs:976-1060","adapter/whale-bridge.mjs:315-405"]}
{"unit_id":"Rccccc6__Tongji-AGI-Credit#card-en","repo":"Rccccc6/Tongji-AGI-Credit","commit":"bc18771cf6872abbbaa73082fcbfa8ba59fff898","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Tongji AGI Credit is a DSH plugin for checking Tongji AGI credits. It adds a balance panel and connects data to the Whale widget through a local interface. Users can view remaining credits and daily usage, and keep login settings in the plugin vault. A Tongji identity account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:79-150","lib/agi-session.mjs:976-1060","adapter/whale-bridge.mjs:315-405"]}
